Name Rio Note - Institute #1 Field Analysis

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Recently one of the interns noted how a good portion of refugees from the nothern areas of Niterói came to us red-eyed, I then did some research and, sure enough, other field camps observed a similar case with their refugees from the same area.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 At first we thought it might have to do with the infection, however blood analysis came negative to the virus; it did, however, detect trace amounts of unknown chemical compounds.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Interviews with the affected refugees didn't shed much light into why that is. People have, however, reported that they heard a weird ringing in their ears followed by a strange smell around the time the infected became unusually active in the area.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 I believe further research might be warranted.